            <td data-label="Where"><strong>{row.body}</strong></td>
            <td data-label="What the document says">{row.says}</td>
            <td data-label="What to do">{row.todo}</td>
          </tr>
        ))}
      </tbody>
    </table>
  </div>

  <p class="note-line">
    Checked on 30 October 2026 against the sources named in the table. The pilot and merchant navy rows
    rest on secondary descriptions, so confirm with the regulator before you decide.
  </p>

