        <p class="route-row route-row--teal"><span>How it grows</span>{r.grow}</p>
      </div>
    ))}
  </div>

  <div class="highlight-box highlight-box--teal">
    <p>
      <strong>The ownership path:</strong> accessibility is a niche that needs the people it serves.
      A colour-blind designer or developer who audits websites and apps for contrast can sell a fixed-price
      review to small firms.
    </p>
    <p>
      Repeat audits, training sessions for design teams and a checklist product can follow. Put the
      scope and price in writing, and keep your own client list.
    </p>
