      organisations' technical, civil or administrative roles, and at cybersecurity, data, logistics
      and operations careers. They keep the mission and often have a higher ceiling.
    </p>
  </div>

  <h2 id="two-stage">Routes with a medical gate</h2>

  <p>
    On three routes, the medical test can end the process after you have already paid and prepared.
    Check it first.
  </p>

